# Overrides that must win over the board definition's own defaults
# (gen_bmgr_codes/board_manager.defaults). The board manager reports that its
# file has higher priority than the project sdkconfig.defaults, so this is the
# slot for a value the product has to change on top of the board.

# The framework's default event-loop task ("sys_evt") dispatches the Wi-Fi and IP
# events. On this panel it overflows its stock 2304-byte stack on the first
# configured boot. Measured: 4096 is in the built image (build/config/sdkconfig.h)
# and the fault point did not move, so the overflow is inside the framework's own
# Wi-Fi/IP dispatch, on this task's stack, before any code of ours is reached.
# Every event the panel cares about is now delivered through a queue to app_mqtt's
# own "mqtt_net" task, and this leaves the shared task the headroom its dispatch
# needs; the exact requirement of the framework path is not documented anywhere.
CONFIG_ESP_SYSTEM_EVENT_TASK_STACK_SIZE=8192
